  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "あたたかい　ちほうの　うみから\nながれついた　かも　しれない\nしろくて　きれいな　かいがら。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "따뜻한 지방의 바다에서\n흘러들어 왔을지도 모르는\n하얗고 예쁜 조개껍질.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "美麗的白色貝殼。\n可能是從溫暖的海域\n漂流過來的。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un joli coquillage blanc. Il a peut-être été porté\npar les vagues depuis une région tropicale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine wunderschöne weiße Muschelschale. Vermutlich\nstammt sie aus dem Meer einer wärmeren Region und\nwurde von der Strömung angespült.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Preciosa concha de color blanco que quizá haya sido\narrastrada por las corrientes marinas desde mares de\nregiones más cálidas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una bellissima conchiglia bianca, forse arrivata dalle\nregioni calde sulla scia delle correnti marine.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A beautiful white shell that may have drifted from\na sea in a warm region.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "あたたかい　地方の　海から\n流れついた　かも　しれない\n白くて　きれいな　貝がら。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "美丽的白色贝壳。\n或许是从温暖的海域那里\n漂流到这里的。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
